# Copy to secrets/models.env (git-ignored) for a real model in local dev; never commit or print it.
# A key already exported in your shell wins over this file.
# Without STUDIO_AGENT_MODEL, `pnpm dev` runs the agent's default model when a key is set, and
# `scripted` (free, deterministic) when there's no key at all.
#
# Providers and their models: apps/agent/src/agent/providers/ (one file each); the default is
# ACTIVE in providers/index.ts. One key is enough: the one for the model you run.
STUDIO_AGENT_MUSE_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# STUDIO_AGENT_MODEL=muse:muse-wonder-1.0
